       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLSUBDEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FIRST-NUM PIC 9(4) VALUE 12.
       01 SECOND-NUM PIC 9(4) VALUE 30.
       01 RESULT-NUM PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "ADDNUMS" USING FIRST-NUM SECOND-NUM RESULT-NUM
           DISPLAY "SUM: " RESULT-NUM
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALLSUBDEMO.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDNUMS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 IN-A PIC 9(4).
       01 IN-B PIC 9(4).
       01 OUT-SUM PIC 9(5).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING IN-A IN-B OUT-SUM.
           COMPUTE OUT-SUM = IN-A + IN-B
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ADDNUMS.
